ちょ、ちょっと！それ何してるの！
Wait, hold on! What are you doing?!

297
00:33:37,270 --> 00:33:40,020
ん？ 何って……実験？
Huh? What do you mean... an experiment?

298
00:33:40,120 --> 00:33:45,020
それぜっっっったいだめだよ！ なんかめちゃくちゃ嫌な濁り方してるって！
That's abso-lutely no good! It's turning into some super gross, murky mixture!

299
00:33:45,120 --> 00:33:47,020
え？ それがいいんじゃん
Eh? But that's what makes it good.

300
00:33:47,120 --> 00:33:51,920
やめようよ！ それ掃除するの沙花叉の仕事になるんだからさぁ！！
Stop it! Cleaning that up is going to be my job!!

301
00:33:52,070 --> 00:33:58,570
ふふふふ……知ってる？ 奇跡も！ 魔法も！ あるらしいよ！
Hehehehe... did you know? Miracles! Magic! Apparently they exist!

302
00:33:59,070 --> 00:34:03,570
もうすでにおかしくなってんじゃん！ もーーーーーっ！
You've already gone crazy! Jeez──────!

303
00:34:28,070 --> 00:34:38,570
伝えあった こころの温度を そっと大事そうに抱え歩いていた
We gently cradled and walked with the temperature of the hearts we shared.

304
00:34:39,070 --> 00:34:47,570
答えのない 願いの中で 言葉は未来へ変えて
Within a wish with no answer, turning words into the future...

305
00:34:48,570 --> 00:34:59,570
幼い頃 ずっと夢に見ていた 私にはまだ遠いけど 君がいれば
Ever since I was little, I've always dreamed of it. It's still far off for me, but as long as you are here...

306
00:35:00,208 --> 00:35:04,708
少しは強くなれる気がして
Feeling like I can become a little stronger,

307
00:35:05,108 --> 00:35:09,008
明日の色に染まった
I was dyed in tomorrow's colors.

308
00:35:11,208 --> 00:35:15,708
呼んだ希望を辿って止めた世界を越えた
Tracing the hope I called out for, I crossed the paused world.

309
00:35:16,408 --> 00:35:22,008
諦めない想いいつしか心繋げた
Feelings of never giving up eventually connected our hearts.

310
00:35:22,508 --> 00:35:27,708
泣いてだって笑って明日迎えに行こう
Even if we cry, let's smile and go meet tomorrow.

311
00:35:28,308 --> 00:35:33,708
君たちが繋がって倒れても君の心を守るため
Even if you collapse while connected, to protect your heart...

312
00:35:51,008 --> 00:36:01,208
記憶のない時の流れにきっと求めていた温かさがあって
In the dateless flow of time, there was surely a warmth I had been seeking.

313
00:36:01,708 --> 00:36:10,208
包まれた瞬間すべての想いは君へ巡る
The moment I was enveloped, all my feelings circulate back to you.

314
00:36:11,408 --> 00:36:17,708
空に向かって走り手にしたいくつもの尊い光胸にしまって
Running toward the sky, I hold countless precious lights close to my chest.

315
00:36:23,208 --> 00:36:32,408
私の中の輝きに影迷いを全部掲げ飛ぼう
Lifting all the shadows and hesitations into the radiance within me, let's fly!

316
00:36:34,208 --> 00:36:45,208
世界の見えない入り組んだ迷路を抜け君が流した涙で心目覚めた
Escaping the unseen, tangled labyrinth of the world, my heart awakened by the tears you shed.

317
00:36:46,208 --> 00:36:54,708
そして知った世界はこんなにもまばゆくて新しい可能性を生むだろう
And the world we came to know is so dazzling, it will surely birth new possibilities.

318
00:36:55,408 --> 00:37:01,208
時の欠片の願いが
The wishes of time's fragments...

319
00:37:13,208 --> 00:37:22,708
救い信じて割れた想い私から始まりだって
Believing in salvation, shattered feelings—this is where it all began for me.

320
00:37:23,708 --> 00:37:30,208
君の笑顔を取り戻すよ真実の奇跡になって
I will bring back your smile, becoming a true miracle.

321
00:37:32,708 --> 00:37:36,708
君の側で…
By your side...

322
00:37:37,208 --> 00:37:41,708
