More importantly, come on, let's go, Iroha!

379
00:43:18,074 --> 00:43:19,354
おう、でござるっ！
Understood, de gozaru!

380
00:43:42,719 --> 00:43:46,419
[Title: Catch the Moment]

381
00:43:52,409 --> 00:43:57,109
そっと はきだす ためいき を すいこんで
Taking in the sigh I softly breathed out,

382
00:43:57,409 --> 00:44:01,029
こうかい は にがい あじ の こすてて
leaving behind the bitter taste of regret.

383
00:44:02,709 --> 00:44:06,409
いつも なんで かんじ な こと いえない まま
Always unable to say what truly matters,

384
00:44:06,709 --> 00:44:10,409
つぎ の あさい ひかり を だして
bringing out the next shallow light,

385
00:44:10,709 --> 00:44:14,409
いやに なった うんめい を ナイフ で きりきざんで
slashing up my annoying fate with a knife,

386
00:44:14,709 --> 00:44:18,409
もっかい じゃん と やりなおしたら きみ に であえない かも
if I started over saying one more time, maybe I wouldn't have met you.

387
00:44:26,709 --> 00:44:30,409
ぼく の こえ が ひびいた とき に はじまる いろそり
The moment my voice echoes, the color starts,

388
00:44:30,709 --> 00:44:34,409
リミット しんぞう が カウントしてる
my heart's limit is counting down.

389
00:44:34,709 --> 00:44:38,409
かなえて も かなえて も おわらない ねがい
No matter how many wishes come true, it never ends,

390
00:44:38,709 --> 00:44:42,409
あせ を かいて はしった せかい の びょうしん は
the second hand of the world I ran through while sweating

391
00:44:42,709 --> 00:44:46,409
いつか とまった ぼく は おいて いく
eventually stopped and left me behind.

392
00:44:47,209 --> 00:44:51,409
あと なんかい きみ と
How many more times with you...

393
00:45:01,348 --> 00:45:03,168
何回だって何回だって
Countless times, countless times...

394
00:45:04,008 --> 00:45:06,868
試してんだ僕を Catch the Moment
testing myself, Catch the Moment!

395
00:45:07,128 --> 00:45:09,828
駆け抜けていくんだよ
I'm going to run right through!

396
00:45:17,898 --> 00:45:21,378
一歩 幸せを数えるたびに
Every time I count a step of happiness,

397
00:45:21,958 --> 00:45:25,478
変わっていく未来に怯えて
growing frightened of the changing future,

398
00:45:25,778 --> 00:45:32,918
しまうけど 愛情の 誰かを大切に育てよう
though I still want to cherish someone's affection...

399
00:45:34,258 --> 00:45:37,658
あたたかい雲も やがて
Even warm clouds will eventually...

400
00:45:38,078 --> 00:45:41,178
突き破るかな
break right through them!

401
00:45:42,058 --> 00:45:47,398
君の声が 響いた ここは 全身も通って
Your voice echoed through my entire body,

402
00:45:48,058 --> 00:45:52,998
心の 灯火のなか 消して
burning bright within the lamp of my heart.

403
00:45:53,798 --> 00:45:57,558
臆病でも 明けちゃうんだよ
Even if I'm a coward, day will break,

404
00:45:58,058 --> 00:46:02,078
信じたいから
because I want to believe!

405
00:46:02,818 --> 00:46:07,778
何もないと 思ったはずの 足元にいつか
Someday, right beneath my feet where I thought was nothing,

406
00:46:08,138 --> 00:46:12,418
深く 確かな 目をはやし
deep and certain roots will sprout...

407
00:46:13,718 --> 00:46:18,678
愛しの 夜が来たとしても
Even if a beloved night comes,

408
00:46:20,018 --> 00:46:22,938
揺らいだりわしね 何もでも
I won't waver, no matter what!

409
00:46:23,258 --> 00:46:28,138
追いついたり 追い越したり 君が不意に見えなくなって
Catching up, passing you by, suddenly losing sight of you—

410
00:46:28,798 --> 00:46:34,378
息をした タイミングが 合うだけで嬉しくなったりして
just breathing at the exact same time makes me so happy.

411
00:46:34,718 --> 00:46:43,338
集めた 一秒を 永遠にして 行けたらな
If only I could turn these gathered seconds into eternity...

412
00:46:58,508 --> 00:47:02,988
ふとつの声が 響いた ときに
When a sudden voice echoes,

413
00:47:03,668 --> 00:47:08,468
始まる 命の リミット 心が 感動してる
the limit of life begins, and my heart is moved.

414
00:47:09,388 --> 00:47:16,348
叶えても 叶えても 終わらない 願い
No matter how many times dreams come true, the wish never ends—

415
00:47:17,148 --> 00:47:23,428
汗をかいて 走った 世界の 秒針がいつか
The second hand of a world I ran through, sweating—

416
00:47:23,808 --> 00:47:28,608
止まった 僕を 置いていく 後ろから
if it ever stopped and left me behind,

417
00:47:29,028 --> 00:47:35,228
君と 笑えるの 試してた 僕を
I want to be able to laugh with you. Testing myself,

418
00:47:37,728 --> 00:47:40,908
Catch the Moment

419
00:47:41,488 --> 00:47:47,368
逃がさないよ 僕は この 時を つかめ
I won't let you escape, I'll seize this moment!

420
00:47:48,388 --> 00:48:00,888
Catch the Moment

421
00:48:18,038 --> 00:48:20,898
[Text: と、まぁ、こんな感じで全員揃いました……と]
[Text: And, well, with that everyone is gathered......]

422
00:48:21,108 --> 00:48:24,088
[Text: こんな感じって、どんな感じですか……総帥？]
[Text: "Like that"? What kind of feeling is that...... Boss?]

423
00:48:24,828 --> 00:48:27,668
[Text: まぁ、こんな感じってことは、こんな感じだよね～ラプちゃん？]
[Text: Well, "like that" means just like that, right~ Rapu-chan?]

424
00:48:28,208 --> 00:48:30,088
[Text: 相変わらず、適当言ってるなぁ……]
[Text: As usual, talking nonsense......]

425
00:48:30,418 --> 00:48:32,978
[Text: まあまあ、それもholoXっぽいてでござるよ]
[Text: Now, now, that's also very holoX-like forsooth.]

426
00:48:33,488 --> 00:48:37,568
[Text: うるさい！holoXの戦いはここからなんできゅー！お前ら準備はいいか!!]
[Text: Shut up! holoX's battle starts right here! Are you guys ready?!]

427
00:48:37,968 --> 00:48:42,048
