白いイヤホンを耳にあて 少しニヤッとして合図する
Pressing white earphones to my ears, I smirk and give the signal.

429
00:49:38,388 --> 00:49:42,808
染め込んだこの温度が 扉をノックした瞬間につま弾く
The temperature soaked inside strums the moment it knocks on the door.

430
00:49:43,068 --> 00:49:45,208
そうになるよ まだ見えない 目を凝らして望む
It's about to... straining my eyes to gaze at what's still unseen.

431
00:49:45,528 --> 00:49:52,988
あの日 躊躇したこの扉から 今すぐに戻すとコードが鳴り出す
From that day's hesitant door, the cord starts ringing to bring it back right now.

432
00:49:53,488 --> 00:50:01,868
見失ってく 世界を 決めた 一人きりのロー
A lonely law that decided a losing world...

433
00:50:02,984 --> 00:50:04,704
正面少女 前を向け
Front-facing girl, look ahead!

434
00:50:04,844 --> 00:50:09,064
揺れる運転手ら 希望論だって
Swaying drivers, even optimistic theories...

435
00:50:10,464 --> 00:50:14,414
正面少女 前を向け 揺れる運転手ら 希望論だって
Front-facing girl, look ahead, swaying drivers, even optimistic theories...

436
00:50:14,664 --> 00:50:17,164
すれ違えばすぐ 終点さ
Passing by instantly leads to the final stop,

437
00:50:17,314 --> 00:50:19,914
雲ひとつもねぇ夏のそうぞうりょく
With not a single cloud in summer's imagination.

438
00:50:20,264 --> 00:50:24,464
この世を狂わせ 生存病の 外側あの世界へ
To that world outside the survival disease driving this world mad!

439
00:50:24,914 --> 00:50:30,214
飛び交う罵声 さあ注目だね
Cries flying around, now pay attention!

440
00:50:35,314 --> 00:50:39,414
お先にどうぞって 新宿が吸っていうぶった斬っちゃえ
"After you," Shinjuku says—slash them all down!

441
00:50:40,014 --> 00:50:44,614
ほら出番だパスワードで目を覚ましたじゃじゃ馬も止まらない
Look, it's our turn! The untamable horse woken by the password won't stop!

442
00:50:44,814 --> 00:50:49,114
もう夜が深くなる お子様なら燃える延長戦
The night grows deeper now, an overtime match burning for kids!

443
00:50:49,414 --> 00:50:53,764
夜行 遠く 巡る 眠れないね まだまだほら早く早く
Night travel, far and round, still unable to sleep—come on, hurry, hurry!

444
00:50:54,214 --> 00:50:58,314
一歩手前で 視線を合わせて ハイタッチで ビートが鳴り出せば
One step short, locking gazes, if the beat rings out with a high-five,

445
00:50:58,764 --> 00:51:02,614
ぱんぱいあちゃん こすい日照り ほら乗っかってこうぜ
Vampire-chan, sly drought, come on, let's ride along!

446
00:51:02,914 --> 00:51:07,114
ワンコードで 視線を合わせて ぶっ飛ばんだグルーブが渦巻けば
With a single chord, locking gazes, if a blown-away groove swirls around,

447
00:51:07,264 --> 00:51:12,264
上等時代 見えるはず 上等ハイエンドの 風景の隙間に
An elite era should be visible, right in the gaps of the high-end scenery!

448
00:51:12,564 --> 00:51:16,914
ちゃんとないこの厚さも すれ違いそうだったカタチも
This thickness that shouldn't be here, the shapes that almost passed each other by—

449
