正面少女 前を向け 暗め運転手ら 希望論だって
Front-facing girl, look ahead, gloomy drivers, even optimistic theories...

457
00:51:51,314 --> 00:51:55,214
掴み取れ 掴み取れと 太陽が熱く燃えたぎる作戦
Grab it, grab it, the operation where the sun burns fiercely!

458
00:51:55,464 --> 00:51:59,164
これが最期にしよう さぁぜんぶさんはその目を見開いた
Let's make this the last time, everyone opened their eyes wide!

459
00:51:59,414 --> 00:52:04,664
凡案な妄想 戦々恐々 感情線のメビウスの先へ
Mediocre delusions, trembling in fear, beyond the Möbius strip of emotion lines!

460
00:52:19,464 --> 00:52:24,664
[Title: holoXスペシャルメドレー 編曲:山下洋介 / 佐伯高志]
[Title: holoX Special Medley Arranged by: Yosuke Yamashita / Takashi Saeki]

461
00:52:24,664 --> 00:52:26,664
そこに爪痕つけ
Leave your mark right there!

462
00:52:26,664 --> 00:52:29,164
対峙してるような現実とは いったい両断叩き切れ
Reality, as if confronting us—slash it cleanly in two!

463
00:52:29,514 --> 00:52:32,864
終わりなき輪廻に迷いし子らよ
Children wandering in endless reincarnation,

464
00:52:32,964 --> 00:52:35,664
漆黒の翼でいざなう
Guided by jet-black wings.

465
00:52:35,764 --> 00:52:39,664
我ら エデンの星を滑るもの 秘密結社 holoX!
We are those who glide across Eden's stars, Secret Society holoX!

466
00:52:39,964 --> 00:52:41,664
ざわれ! 狂い咲け!
Roar! Bloom wildly!

467
00:52:57,664 --> 00:53:06,664
[Title: Hakui Koyori 1st Original Song]

468
00:53:08,164 --> 00:53:14,464
あっちゃこっちゃびっくりすりほど決まりじゃん間違って悩んだりぽっかりじゃん
It's totally set to surprise you everywhere, worrying over mistakes is just empty space,

469
00:53:14,664 --> 00:53:19,464
けど君に見つけてほしくて 僕は君の歌に組んだベアタならハッピー!
But I want you to find me, if you're the partner paired with my song, it's happy!

470
00:53:19,664 --> 00:53:25,164
カワイクチャッチャエ 内手泣いて泣いて愛してピップ送って
Cute, chat-chat, cry, cry, love and send a pip,

471
00:53:25,414 --> 00:53:32,864
ダメなぼくのこと覚えといて もう君の心からチュッとしちゃえ!
Remember clumsy old me, and steal a kiss straight from your heart!

472
00:53:38,464 --> 00:53:45,164
先の見えない人生 自分の道と両面オーケー!
A life with no ahead in sight, your own path and both ways are okay!

473
00:53:45,464 --> 00:53:49,464
生きてりゃきっとなんとかなるさ
If you keep living, things will surely work out somehow!

474
00:53:49,664 --> 00:53:52,664
大丈夫 大丈夫
It's alright, it's alright!

475
00:53:52,764 --> 00:53:56,664
後ろ前 方向なんてお構い
Back and front, directions don't matter at all,

476
00:53:56,764 --> 00:54:02,464
こんな迷宮入りの毎日も 一歩歩き出せたら
Even in such labyrinthine days, if you can just take a step forward,

477
00:54:02,664 --> 00:54:07,164
それが前になるのさ 万全快調気分な朝でも
That becomes the front! Even on mornings when you feel in top shape,

478
00:54:07,414 --> 00:54:12,564
頭ずっしり君の夜でも 風がいつも吹いてる
Or nights when your head is heavy with thoughts of you, the wind is always blowing.

479
00:54:12,664 --> 00:54:18,164
心配しないで 一緒にファイトで勝ったり
Don't worry, let's fight and win together!

480
00:54:30,764 --> 00:54:39,164
すれ違って濁ってアイラブ自分 いつだってそうやって曇って不干渉 大きなキズをしてみるけど
Passing by, turning cloudy, I love myself—always clouding over with non-interference, trying out big wounds,

481
00:54:39,414 --> 00:54:45,664
乾いた傘だって鳴るんだ わがままに選んではポイントして 理屈抜きで夢とか信じたい
But even a dry umbrella rings out, selfishly choosing and pointing, wanting to believe in dreams without reason.

482
00:54:45,864 --> 00:54:51,164
レトロルドかしちゃえばりおねっと鳴んないじゃん 期待感こっこいい目を もっと
If you retro-ruled it, marionettes wouldn't ring—give me more expectation and cool eyes!

483
00:54:51,414 --> 00:54:55,664
すまんないアスファルトのシンデレラ 叶えたい 消えたい
Sorry, asphalt Cinderella, wanting to make it come true, wanting to disappear...

484
00:55:03,029 --> 00:55:06,489
忘れてしまいたいんだ 僕と僕の境界線
I want to forget... the boundary between you and me.

485
00:55:06,849 --> 00:55:08,489
どれも正解で
Every single one is right.

486
00:55:08,769 --> 00:55:15,429
どれも正解だ 叶えたい 消えたい 歪んでいくんだ 僕と僕の境界線
Every single one is right. I want to make it come true, I want to disappear, warping—the boundary between you and me.

487
00:55:16,049 --> 00:55:18,289
君だけに教えてもいっか
Is it okay if I teach only you?

488
00:55:30,129 --> 00:55:33,269
めきなさい またハプニング
Sparkle once more, another happening!

489
00:55:33,769 --> 00:55:38,189
君が君でいらぬ気晴らし
Unnecessary venting because you are you.

490
00:55:38,449 --> 00:55:42,289
不毛な道徳 散らすノイズ
Barren morality, scattering noise.

491
00:55:42,689 --> 00:55:45,789
乗るこごえで ハイ！ アップサイドダウン
Riding on the shivering voice, high! Upside down!

492
00:55:48,329 --> 00:55:56,009
我が道を行くマイノリティ 艶やかアイロニー 知らん顔セルフワハート のざつごめえ
Walking my own path as a minority, seductive irony, playing dumb with a self-aware heart...

493
00:55:57,109 --> 00:56:03,329
夢かき集めて形 掬い上げる風に 銃のすべて解き明かす
Gathering dreams into shape, scooping them up in the wind, unraveling all of the guns...

494
00:56:03,709 --> 00:56:10,429
心満たすよ その伸びてきな知識を 刺激してして気に 入ってる身体も素敵さ
Fulfilling the heart, stimulating that growing knowledge, even the body you've come to like is wonderful!

495
00:56:10,769 --> 00:56:15,129
我が道を行く 今日もさ！
Walking my own path today as well!

496
00:56:33,849 --> 00:56:40,489
さあ だんだんまだんだん 迷子迷子 痛いね そんな強い言葉は
Now, step by step, getting lost, getting lost, it hurts, such strong words...

497
00:56:40,869 --> 00:56:44,469
少しだけ静かにしてほしいね ああ
I want you to be just a little quiet, ah...

498
00:56:45,049 --> 00:56:47,989
私たち耐えて
Enduring it together...

499
00:56:48,569 --> 00:56:51,709
今と未来 見たかった初めなのに
Even though it was the first time I wanted to see the present and future...

500
00:56:55,989 --> 00:57:02,689
とこととことんえええ この世の理 よよよ 今ぜんぜん全滅さっさっさ あなたの街
On and on and on, the reason of this world, now completely wiped out, your town...

501
00:57:03,449 --> 00:57:09,949
ながーくづづづるは待って さしかい ててて 眠気 ややや 果たすその日まで れれれ ごく やや や あなたの周りも よよよ
Waiting for it to last long, substituting, sleepiness, until the day it's fulfilled...

502
00:57:14,669 --> 00:57:19,589
約束の地まで さあ 掲げよ ばってん ばってん ててて 全力
To the promised land, now raise it up, cross, cross, with all your might...

503
